        <mxCell id="cell-101" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Local strength &lt; 1: noise an encoded coarse RGB crop and run the remaining DDIM steps. At strength = 1 (app default), start from fresh noise.&#10;Inference uses EMA U-Net + EMA mask decoder. The original RGB VAE and text encoder stay fixed. No weights are updated." style="html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;fontColor=#171717;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=3;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#171717;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;">
